/-!
# Residual geometry of the original nonbinary G₂ flag

Exports the actual marked stabilizers, literal PSL₂ core quotients,
generation of L by its two local residuals and by the residuals of its plane
orbit, and the original plane vector and actor maps with exact kernels.
The quotient-plane action is the natural SL₂ two-space through those same
projections. The orbit has intersection V1 and span V3. Its corrected Sylow
displacement description gives normalizer control, conditional only on the
earlier independent unique-noncentral-component input.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith 11.0.2, opening §11.1 and 11.1.4, pp.759--761,765.
-/
